docs {
  # GET /api/v1/ai/forecast

  Deterministic early-warning projection (province trajectories + anomalies)
  derived from severity + volume signals. Powers the bell/notifications menu in
  the app shell. Zero-cost, no LLM.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/ai/forecast/route.ts`
  **Auth:** none at the route.

  ## Response (200) — `ForecastResult`
  ```json
  {
    "generated": "28 Mei, 22.10",
    "provinces": [
      { "name": "Jawa Barat", "city": "Bekasi", "trajectory": "naik", "probability": 82, "drivers": "isu keracunan, 9 artikel" }
    ],
    "anomalies": [
      { "title": "Lonjakan narasi \"keracunan\"", "detail": "...", "severity": "high" }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
